  "${@0} = ({@1})^2 - {@2}^2$, je to rozdiel štvorcov: $a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$, teda ${@3}$.": "${@0} = ({@1})^2 - {@2}^2$, which is a difference of two squares: $a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$, so ${@3}$.",
  "${@0} = {@1}^2$ a ${@2}x = 2\\cdot x\\cdot {@3}$, takže ide o vzorec $(a {@4} b)^2 = a^2 {@5} 2ab + b^2$: ${@6} = {@7}$.": "${@0} = {@1}^2$ and ${@2}x = 2\\cdot x\\cdot {@3}$, so this is the formula $(a {@4} b)^2 = a^2 {@5} 2ab + b^2$: ${@6} = {@7}$.",
