  "Dosadíme $x = 0$: $y_0 = {@0}$. Je to absolútny člen $q$ v predpise.": "We substitute $x = 0$: $y_0 = {@0}$. This is the constant term $q$ in the equation.",
  "Dosaď $y$ do prvej rovnice. Aké je $x$?": "Substitute $y$ into the first equation. What is $x$?",
