  "Graf funkcie $y = {@0}$ pretína os $x$ v bode $[x_0;\\, 0]$. Urči $x_0$.": "The graph of the function $y = {@0}$ crosses the $x$-axis at the point $[x_0;\\, 0]$. Find $x_0$.",
